124### Immutable Function for Better Optimization
125
126```sql
127create or replace function my_schema.full_name(first_name text, last_name text)
128returns text
129language sql
130security invoker
131set search_path = ''
132immutable
133as $$
134  select first_name || ' ' || last_name;
135$$;
136```